ight: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: collapse;\">전달 기간을 감안하여 3월 19일(수)까지 모집을 받을 예정이오니 참고 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: collapse;\">(이후 경상북도에서 모든 대학 지원자들 서류를 취합하여 주니가타총영사관으로 서류 제출할 예정)</span></p></pre></pre><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.625rem; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; text-wrap: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12.25px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center;\"><br></p></pre></pre></pre></pre><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; background: transparent; font-size: 15px; transition: background 0.15s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;SCDream Gothic&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Apple SD